NOTICE — data used by this project
==================================

The MIT licence in LICENSE covers the code and the documentation only.
No dataset and no derived data file is redistributed in this repository.

Source dataset
--------------
  pkchwy/letterboxd-all-movie-data
  https://huggingface.co/datasets/pkchwy/letterboxd-all-movie-data
  Declared licence on Hugging Face: MIT
  1.12 GB, 847,209 films, up to 10 reviews each.

Why it is not redistributed here
--------------------------------
  1. The intermediate .parquet files (32 MB) are regenerated by
     01_preprocesamiento.ipynb in a few minutes. Versioning derived data
     that rebuilds itself adds weight and no value.

  2. They contain review text written by real people. Analysing it is one
     thing; republishing it is another.

  3. The MIT declaration is made by whoever uploaded the dataset, not by
     Letterboxd nor by the people who wrote the reviews. It does not reach
     third-party text.

Only `title`, `year`, `rating` and the review text are used. Usernames are
never extracted.
